Negative control for catalogue-template.test.ts.

Declares the pick with a fallback its record does not carry, so a brand with no
template, an empty one, or a name the page does not lay out gets no layout
instead of the full one. The full template still draws its own layout.

Intended RED (catalogue-template.test.ts, "catalogueTemplate"):
  draws the full layout for no template
  draws the full layout for an empty template
  draws the full layout for a template only other pages carry
  draws the full layout for a name no layout carries
  draws the full layout for a name every object inherits
Intended GREEN:
  draws the layout the <each> template carries

